Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:38.00,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)}{\an2\pos(960,1067.286)}翻译：蛮牛 常暗 petyoo  校对：库洛西   时轴：C.Amemori    后期：大米
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.38,0:01:43.18,Screen,1,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)\fn方正兰亭粗黑_GBK\shad2\an2\bord2\fs80\c&H8E2F89&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\4a&H61&\3a&H00&\pos(1394,774.8)}复兴{\c&H0692FA&}计划 {\c&H90348C&}其{\c&H0492F6&}1 \N{\c&H90348C&}贾希大人回不去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:01.31,DefaultTop,1,0,0,0,,付了钱的话 今天也什么都吃不了了
